      "message": "Hi @linzhen@google.com, I wanted to give some context on this CL:\n\n- This is a port of the SVT-AV1-PSY\u0027s \"enhanced screen content\" algorithm, refactored to align with libaom\u0027s code standards and to use libaom\u0027s native functions.\n- This CL is intended to be mainly used with still image coding\u0027s `tune\u003diq`, but it can also benefit videos.\n- I\u0027m currently working on addressing @wtc@google.com\u0027s comments. The algorithm side is essentially complete, and its invocation will be resurfaced as a new codec control instead of a separate `--tune-content` value.\n\nLet me know if you have any questions.",
